3. NO WARRANTY ON COMPLIANCE OUTCOMES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is structured guidance based on our reading of the NIS 2 Directive
(Directive (EU) 2022/2555), CIR 2024/2690, ENISA Technical Implementation
Guidance, the NIS Cooperation Group common templates, the W3C DPV NIS 2
vocabulary, and individual national portal field lists where indicated. It
is not legal advice and confers no guarantee that any user of this material
will satisfy any specific national reporting obligation, pass an audit, or
avoid regulatory penalties. Consult qualified counsel for your situation.
